{"id":"3eb54eb75a5edfec","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-box-implies-box-box.md","title":"Box Implies Box Box","display":"cor-box-implies-box-box — Box Implies Box Box","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-box-implies-box-box","aliases":["89-cor-box-implies-box-box"],"display":"cor-box-implies-box-box — Box Implies Box Box","depends_on":["[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-box-implies-box-box"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-box-implies-box-box</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-box-implies-box-box — Box Implies Box Box"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7c3acbd110a662db\" href=\"?note=7c3acbd110a662db\" title=\"89-lem-lob-implies-4\">89-lem-lob-implies-4</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}box\\text{-}implies\\text{-}box\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}box\\text{-}implies\\text{-}box\\text{-}box}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A)\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span> : 模态算子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li>4公理：可证蕴涵&quot;可证可证&quot;</li>\n<li>正内化性质 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7c3acbd110a662db\" href=\"?note=7c3acbd110a662db\" title=\"89-lem-lob-implies-4\">89-lem-lob-implies-4</a>)</li>\n<li>GL逻辑的基本推论</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lob-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"7c3acbd110a662db","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref